# ALLI OPS — IMMERSIVE

Premium WebGL interface system built with Spline, Next.js, and motion-driven interaction.

---

## Overview

Alli Ops is a high-end interactive system combining:

- WebGL environments (Spline)
- Editorial UI systems
- Motion-driven UX
- Automation + intelligence infrastructure

This project is designed as a hybrid between:
- Design portfolio
- Interactive product interface
- Scalable system foundation

---

## Stack

- Next.js (App Router)
- Spline (WebGL scenes)
- Framer Motion (animation)
- Lenis (smooth scroll)
- Supabase (backend / data)

---

## Design System

**Aesthetic:**
Premium editorial × WebGL portfolio

**Colors:**
- Base: #EFEAE0 (warm bone)
- Ink: #0D0C0A
- Accent: #E3C68B (champagne)
- Black: #0C0B09

**Typography:**
- Display: Ultra-bold uppercase grotesk
- Meta: Space Mono (uppercase, spaced)

**UI Principles:**
- Rounded 24px bento cards
- Soft gradient shadows (no hard drops)
- 3% film grain overlay
- Edge-to-edge typography
- No pure white or cool gray

---

## Features

- Immersive Spline 3D hero
- Cursor-reactive motion
- Glass / physical material system
- Bento grid UI layout
- Smooth physics-based scrolling
- Modular component architecture

---

